<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Sept producer/import prices -3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Swiss Sept producer/import prices -3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The combined index for Swiss producer and import prices rose 0.2 percent in September from August but stood three percent lower than a year earlier, the Federal Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				   Sept 1996   Aug 1996  Sept 1995</p>
<p>Monthly pct index change   +0.2 pct    -0.5	-0.3</p>
<p>Yr/yr pct index change     -3.0 pct    -3.0	+0.2</p>
<p>Index (100 = May 1993)     96.7	  96.5	99.6</p>
<p>Note - The combined producer/import price index replaced the wholesale price index in May 1993.  </p>
<p>The office also detailed the producer price index:</p>
<p>				   Sept 1996   Aug 1996  Sept 1995</p>
<p> Monthly pct index change  +0.1 pct    -0.5	+0.1</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct index change    -2.2 pct    -2.1	-0.2</p>
<p> Index (100 = May 1993)    97.2	  97.2	99.4</p>
<p>Import price index:</p>
<p>				   Sept 1996   Aug 1996  Sept 1995</p>
<p> Monthly pct index change  +0.5 pct    -0.8	+0.4</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct index change    -4.9 pct    -4.9	-0.4</p>
<p> Index (100 = May 1993)    95.3	  94.9	100.2</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
